OL,3,GNEWSAArchive offers glimpse into life
OL,4,Aof Raymond Briggs
OL,5,
OL,6,FDealing with a new archive of items
OL,7,Fbelonging to The Snowman illustrator
OL,8,FRaymond Briggs "felt a bit like going
OL,9,Finto Tutankhamun's tomb", according to
OL,10,Fan archivist who worked on the project.
OL,12,FChris Olver spent nine months
OL,13,Fcataloguing the personal papers, work
OL,14,Fand records of the renowned cartoonist.
OL,16,FThe collection has been entrusted to
OL,17,Fthe East Sussex and Brighton and Hove
OL,18,FRecord Office at its headquarters, The
OL,19,FKeep, by the estate of Raymond Briggs.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
